{"ref":"BDB, פְּנִינִים","hw":"פְּנִינִים","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">פְּנִינִים</span></big>  <strong>n.</strong>[<strong>f.</strong>]<strong>pl. corals (</strong>? as <em>branching</em>, cf. Arabic <span dir=\"rtl\">فَنَنٌ</span> <em>branch</em> of tree; so Mich Thes al.; > <em>pearls</em> Bo<sup>Hieroz. 601</sup> Di Jb after Ra al.<strong>)</strong>;—<span dir=\"rtl\">פ׳</span> fig. of value <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 20:15\" href=\"/Proverbs.20.15\">Pr 20:15</a>; usu.<span dir=\"rtl\">מִפּ׳</span>, comp. <a data-ref=\"Job 28:18\" href=\"/Job.28.18\">Jb 28:18</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 3:15\" href=\"/Proverbs.3.15\">Pr 3:15</a> (Kt <span dir=\"rtl\">מפניים</span>), <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 8:11\" href=\"/Proverbs.8.11\">8:11</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 31:10\" href=\"/Proverbs.31.10\">31:10</a> (all of value), <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 4:7\" href=\"/Lamentations.4.7\">La 4:7</a> (of red colour); + <a data-ref=\"Psalms 45:14\" href=\"/Psalms.45.14\">ψ 45:14</a> (perhaps; for <span dir=\"rtl\">פְּנִימָה</span>, q.v.).","next":"BDB, פְּנִנָּה","prev":"BDB, פִּנָּה"}